<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12 d-flex flex-column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:2columns:34:93-1:2 Columns - Equal:1">
<div class="text-white card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-dark-50 text-light" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:32:49"><div class="fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column" style="padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;">
	<div class="fusion-text fusion-text-10" style="color:#f4dd66;">
		<h5 class="fusion-responsive-typography-calculated" data-fontsize="40" data-lineheight="48px" style="text-align:center;margin:0px;padding:40px;color:rgb(244, 225, 133);--fontSize:40;line-height:1.2;">Use The Salvation Army Corn Center Programs to <strong>Holistically Serve Families and Individuals</strong></h5>
	</div>

	<div class="fusion-text fusion-text-11 sm-text-align-center" style="color:#f2f2f2;">
		<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
			An afterschool program where children can thrive, a performing arts center for children and adults, and weekly fellowship and worship opportunities help those experiencing homelessness find the support they need.
		</p>
	</div>
	<!--<div class="fusion-column-wrapper" style="content:&quot;z-index:-1;position:absolute;inset:0px;background-image:linear-gradient(rgb(0, 149, 218) 0%, rgb(65, 168, 216) 100%);background-position:left top;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;min-height:0px;">
		 
	</div>-->
</div></div>
				</div>
			</div>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:35:19"></div>
<div style="color:#111111;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:36:36"><p style="text-align:center;">
	<strong><span style="font-size:36px;">About Pathway of Hope</span></strong>
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	<span style="font-size:24px;">The Salvation Army’s Pathway of Hope initiative provides individualized services to families with children who desire to take action to break the cycle of crisis and vulnerability that repeats generation after generation.</span>
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	<span style="font-size:24px;">It seeks to address the root causes of poverty in addition to the Army’s history of compassionate serving. By helping families overcome challenges like unemployment, unstable housing, and lack of education, The Salvation Army and collaborative partners can guide families toward increased stability and, ultimately, self-sufficiency.</span>
</p></div>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:37:94"></div>
<div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;background:#000000 url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/03cff804-d96c-4d85-96d8-c11e8fdb3f9f_banner-plan-lightened.jpg') center center / cover no-repeat;background-image:url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/03cff804-d96c-4d85-96d8-c11e8fdb3f9f_banner-plan-lightened.jpg');background-position:center center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;" class="text-white rounded p-6 gap-3 my-5 bg-dark-100 text-light" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:38:93">
            <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;"></div>
            <div style="position:relative;z-index:3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;min-height:300px;">
                <div style="width:100%;padding:40px;color:#FFFFFF;">
                    <p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
	<img src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/96a3b50c-b2ea-43e5-b624-b02223e28f77_amazingplans.png" style="max-max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;" class="d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded">
</p>

<div style="max-width:500px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
	<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
		“The families and individuals who will be coming here will be under the stress of the effects of poverty, among other factors. Having a clean, attractive and secure dining area opening onto a protected courtyard with kid-friendly play environment will help make their stay a good experience for all. The design will enable better changes to begin for the residents as families.”
	</p>
</div>

<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
	<em>Neil Clark, Architect</em>
</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:39:28"></div>
<div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;background:#FFFFFF url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/6bfd08d4-f488-4e67-874d-e79248b97f80_Mother-with-3-daughters-blur-80white.jpg') center center / cover no-repeat;background-image:url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/6bfd08d4-f488-4e67-874d-e79248b97f80_Mother-with-3-daughters-blur-80white.jpg');background-position:center center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3 my-5" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:40:68">
