<p style="text-align:center;">
	<strong><span style="font-size:36px;">Would You Partner With Us? Homeless Families Need You.</span></strong>
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	<span style="font-size:36px;">Contributions and pledges can be made over a 3-5 year period. In addition to cash, contributions of appreciated stock, bonds, and marketable real estate will be accepted. <strong>Will you invest in this Amazing endeavor for our community?</strong></span>
